{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"motion tracking footage quality motion tracking footage quality","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md","fileName":"Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Motion Tracking Footage Quality","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-07 23:25\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Motion Tracking]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Motion Tracking","blenderfordummies4thedition.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"motion tracking footage quality motion tracking footage quality","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md","fileName":"Motion Tracking Footage Quality.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Motion Tracking Footage Quality","heading":"Motion Tracking Footage Quality","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Accurate tracking begins with footage designed for post-production. Useful source material records the camera, keeps lighting stable, preserves clean and sharp frames, and captures physical information about the scene.\n\nBlur makes groups of pixels difficult to follow. Progressive frames, disabled autofocus, limited motion blur, and restrained depth of field provide clearer features; dramatic blur can be reintroduced later after reliable motion and depth have been recovered.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Motion Tracking","blenderfordummies4thedition.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Motion Tracking Footage Qua